check 1
# Horadric Cube recipe 6: 1 perfect gem of each type + 1 amulet -> prismatic amulet
# cubemain row 6: inputs amu,mag gpv gpy gpb gpg gpr gpw -> output amu,mag,pre=331. Generated by tools/checks/gen_cube.py
# (specs/world/cube.md §1-§8): ScnCube holds a cube (page 0) and the inputs (page 3)
# from the start; frame 4 opens the cube (0x20 UseGridItem, §1), frame 8 transmutes
# (0x4F ClickButton 0x18, §3). Compared: state + packets (0x9D action 5 per removed
# item, 0x9C action 4 per output, §8).
name cube-006-1-perfect-gem-of-each-type-1-a
save ScnCube --class ama --expansion --item box --item amu:3/q=magic --item gpv:3 --item gpy:3 --item gpb:3 --item gpg:3 --item gpr:3 --item gpw:3
seed 1234
ticks 24
seconds 300
channels state packets items
at 4 send UseGridItem item=@4 x=0 y=0
at 8 send ClickButton button=0x18 p1=0 p2=0
